# Dev/internal files must not be served publicly. /CLAUDE.md and /scripts/*
# were returning 200 (they exist on disk, so a non-forced rule is shadowed).
# CLAUDE.md exposed the SEO strategy, the Search Console baseline, founder
# decisions and team emails at a guessable URL. Force a 404. Verified exposed
# 2026-08-07; PUBLIC-NARRATIVE.md, _redirects, netlify.toml and .git are not
# in the publish output and already 404.
/CLAUDE.md    /404.html   404!
/scripts/*    /404.html   404!

